+        needs this group to match there. ``_cache_partial_tail_block`` keys
+        only the prompt's last hash boundary, and a longer key or the
+        full-block promotion drops shorter entries on the same block, so the
+        entry is re-added on every call (idempotent: the pool skips a hash it
